check 1
# Area B (q-diff-combat-a1): a champion fallen pack (monstats 19, umod 16
# champion) poked in the Rogue Encampment; the pack idles / wanders (no
# target in town), then Fire Bolts (skill 36 level 5) hit the leader:
# hit reactions, champion life, minion reactions. Spec:
# specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name combat-champion-pack
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 150
seconds 360
channels state
at 4 poke seed-game 0x00001234 666
at 4 poke seed-unit @player 0x00000055 666
at 4 poke spawn 19 @x+4 @y+4 champion umod 16
at 30 poke missile 58 @x @y @x+4 @y+4 skill 36 5
at 50 poke missile 58 @x @y @x+4 @y+4 skill 36 5
at 70 poke missile 58 @x @y @x+4 @y+4 skill 36 30
